    "text": "{\n  \"semantic_type\": \"flow\",\n  \"unit\": \"USD\",\n  \"additive_over_entities\": true,\n  \"additive_over_time\": true,\n  \"time_rollup\": \"sum\",\n  \"valid_methods\": [\"sum_over_time\", \"sum_across_entities\", \"ratio_of_sums\", \"pct_change\"],\n  \"period_basis\": \"mixed\",\n  \"derivation\": \"Reported value of the us-gaap OperatingIncomeLoss concept taken from SEC XBRL company facts for 10-Q filings. Rows with period_basis Q are discrete three-month periods. Rows with period_basis YTD6 are cumulative six-month periods that already include the Q1 and Q2 figures.\",\n  \"calendar\": \"fiscal\",\n  \"seasonal_adjustment\": null,\n  \"annualized\": false,\n  \"entity_grain\": \"ticker (company, identified by cik)\",\n  \"hierarchy\": null,\n  \"comparability\": \"same_definition\",\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"source\": \"SEC EDGAR XBRL company facts API\",\n    \"concept\": \"OperatingIncomeLoss\",\n    \"url_template\": \"https://data.sec.gov/api/xbrl/companyfacts/CIK{cik}.json\",\n    \"retrieved_on\": \"2026-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Operating income (loss) in USD for restaurant companies (CMG, YUM, WING, DRI), reported per fiscal period. This is a flow measure. Summing over time or taking pct_change is only valid when rows are filtered to a single period_basis, normally Q. Adding Q rows to YTD6 rows double counts the same quarters. Fiscal quarter ends differ by company, for example WING and DRI, so align on fiscal_year and fiscal_quarter rather than calendar dates.\"\n}",
